{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "baba350780f3d5aac95a69fc6c1d78b12cdb6d0680f34d4cb3045f1643c5d124", "ja": "新たな強敵", "zh": "全新的强敌", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "69468c6e94627c9ab6a6bfa19835a99d32bda671769d8c4700758a8e0332a2b1", "ja": "新生『I.V.』のオーディションが始まった。\n新たな研修生『暁クロエ』は『I.V.』になる\nために来たと宣言、早速真珠星と険悪に。\nなるも両親が大物芸能人だと暴露されるが、\n改めて真珠星に気持ちを話し、絆が深まる。", "zh": "新生『I.V.』的试镜开始了。\n新来的练习生『暁クロエ』宣称自己是为了成为『I.V.』而来，\n很快便与真珠星关系紧张起来。\n后来她父母是大牌艺人的事被曝光，\n但她再次向真珠星诉说自己的心情，两人的羁绊也因此加深。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "b6ed0d528a5f7a5d06adfc0f6544c24b9a0a636c7cb72a5d178751f245756208", "ja": "笹森藍ソロライブから数日後……", "zh": "笹森蓝个人演唱会几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "f354f9b561012c05f09ed1a1bbf3d978fe5724806a183af5a6fac06d880f669b", "ja": "今回のライブは、ひとまず成功したと\n言っていいでしょう。バックダンサー組、お疲れ様。", "zh": "这次的演出，暂且可以说是成功了。\n担任伴舞的各位，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "df1fc5dd53fbff707fd658c190bcf62b1b10f3c7bef9666d1c24220659cdffc7", "ja": "でも、バックダンサーはひとつの目安にすぎない。\n次はいよいよ、藍の相方を決める試験……。", "zh": "不过，后备舞者也仅仅只是一个参考标准。\n接下来终于要开始决定藍的搭档的考核了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1003_038chz", "source_sha256": "3ffb1c699abfa4e2fb2e3706e067eac5e3c9329a838fb34c33504603155505d4", "ja": "新生『I.V.』、\nメンバーオーディションを始動させます。", "zh": "新生『I.V.』，现在开始成员选拔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "258044012032b26835c8b8cc4f5fd7b878572bf93eefe91697e8a1f797aa3466", "ja": "ようやくだ……。\nようやく、お姉ちゃんの……。", "zh": "总算等到了……\n总算能向姐姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "7018f907d4a28b713209eeba63f430c2800f903215c690510a68d1084ebd6ae7", "ja": "オーディションにあたって、研修生が\n一人追加になるわ。入ってきて。", "zh": "关于试镜的事，培训生要再增加一名了。进来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "8d96c99616e4b673482d2b5cffabdb190e68a206be42de928074a8c022c5f6d3", "ja": "……？\nこんな時に、新しい研修生……？", "zh": "……？\n偏偏在这种时候，来新的研修生……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1007_traineea", "source_sha256": "f4372b1e95ee717f35bbf1794e3c462e1028cd17c9f403bdaa054cde2cf35ca6", "ja": "えっ、ウソ……クロエ！？", "zh": "诶，骗人的吧……克洛伊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1008_traineeb", "source_sha256": "b7ae6ee2f60ef86e51da15826255a12b603c30a27d65bd24aba89a3ae0b8abe2", "ja": "本物、すっごい綺麗……加工とかじゃなくて、\nマジであんな足長いんだ……。", "zh": "真的好漂亮……不是修图什么的，原来她的腿真的那么长……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "97311355dcdae60586c4964311bbce5f124276b0beb556af05cc936383bf1fef", "ja": "……誰？", "zh": "……谁？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "43e3cdd22bd0bcb7535b532804461ab28ac93207c8817f660edd68e74ee57b3e", "ja": "真珠星さん、知らないの！？　クロエ……SNSに\n上げたダンス動画で、いきなりバズった子だよ。", "zh": "珍珠星小姐，你不知道吗！？克洛伊……就是那个因为在社交平台上发布的舞蹈视频，突然走红的女孩。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1011_028ari", "source_sha256": "6f256cb8328def0a698518ca02fc87b2014e367ac6e073a65aa4be042420c509", "ja": "歌もダンスも上手くて、色んな事務所が\n声かけてるって……まさか、うちに来るなんて。", "zh": "听说她唱歌跳舞都很厉害，好多事务所都在联系她……没想到她居然会来我们事务所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "b705242da4423b1f5150c342941ff731e96c9b6811598b0cc263ffc413e0d293", "ja": "ふーん……。", "zh": "哼——……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "ef241dc4e2e612fa629998a1ffacef3229f214bb9010a830853f2d3d62270ae5", "ja": "クロエ、簡単に自己紹介を。", "zh": "克洛伊，简单做个自我介绍吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "44eee4b8ebcef85a2492a16562053f58a0e481decc648bed92ee62c070ccac62", "ja": "暁（あかつき）クロエです。新生『I.V.』の\nメンバーになるためにこの事務所に来ました。", "zh": "我是晓克洛伊。为了成为新生“I.V.”的\n一员，我来到了这家事务所。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "f45d7ffa6c147b3598ad14b10a7e34ad20a6bdfb0139c448e065cc8112c13fd1", "ja": "よろしくお願いします。", "zh": "请多指教了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "d3cfede1a34d6b10a1e6605f5e86e7a96909c7b289636576f555e82176f78fdd", "ja": "……は、はあ！？　新生『I.V.』のメンバーって……\nいきなり何！？　ふざけないで！", "zh": "……哈，啊！？　新生“I.V.”的成员是……\n突然说什么呢！？别开玩笑了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "6f182c7fc6c998c95e6a79381fc2089fb48f855f954d29f0b6384e2e10c0814f", "ja": "？　別に、ふざけてなんかないけど。\n利用できそうなものは利用する……。", "zh": "？　我可没在开玩笑啊。\n能利用的东西就要利用……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "016571a0e8067219d550ea2bfaa41e9c859560a403cc7e7e4764c8eb85ae2ce0", "ja": "あなただって、同じでしょ？　お姉さんの名前を\n使って、そのユニットでデビューしようとしてる。", "zh": "你不也一样吗？用姐姐的名字，想凭那个组合出道。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "9f86a328eefd55590d487f62376768eb5b02bb74cdfcf5e0d4f7c39acca91abf", "ja": "っ……。\n……そ、それとこれとは……！", "zh": "呃……。\n……这、这和那是两回事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "a51e801dabe318611454b2189dabd31269240d5acc623c7d6d64f0c9fccaae43", "ja": "違うの？\n私には同じにしか見えないけど。", "zh": "不一样吗？在我看来明明完全一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "8c2b857818ca95e0ca2f1ff4080138424f6901dabde6059ae6d5cc4e408f9f1a", "ja": "そこにいる子だって……三船なるだっけ。\n確か、三船新一郎の娘だよね？", "zh": "就连那边那个孩子……是叫三船なる来着？  \n我记得，她是三船新一郎的女儿吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "a0f1adb7995fdaa2e2b88fb721f8431b690661cead8535959e005fcb1e24e264", "ja": "っ！！", "zh": "……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "62f5545955c47f351ca4fe9c68ad28d5af96bece11d758608bffb4df06a72a9d", "ja": "（三船新一郎って……テレビでよく見る、\nあの大御所俳優の……？）", "zh": "（三船新一郎……就是那个经常在电视上看到的，大牌演员……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "6fd28c484baf459b6e5b6fac681f317bb4aa93b99ca46abd32f3f330385cdd19", "ja": "良く見ようと悪く見ようと、同じだよ。\nどっちも、名前しか見てない……本質を見てない。", "zh": "不管往好的方面看还是往坏的方面看，都是一样的。两边都只看到了名字……没有看到本质……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "e6b8c1251298e57b66cbba85b08f4fc9900bbc1eec2aa11616bf4cb78de23762", "ja": "私はただ、『私』を見せたい。\nそのために、自分にできる事をするだけ。", "zh": "我只是想展现真正的“我”。为此，我只要做自己力所能及的事就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1027_027say", "source_sha256": "f2b79c3d9b37f13342a6ec5168e130ffc91de142ee1ffd4fcd8b7a6a95becfb9", "ja": "クロエ、もういいわ。\n……神宮寺さん、説明をお願い。", "zh": "克洛伊，已经够了。\n……神宫寺小姐，请你说明一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1028_038chz", "source_sha256": "07c37cb0504cfbaf405f02a28be34d16ab5dd6b22932396819bc2d7f8cbe2ed4", "ja": "そうね。……それじゃあ皆、\n今から配る資料に目を通してちょうだい。", "zh": "没错……那么，各位，\n请看一下接下来要发给你们的资料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1029_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "e512fcdaaf0989b6eb5470875d0f24c39199b7ed50266687c0f5d30634d020f9", "ja": "あのっ、真珠星さん！\nちょっとだけ、寄り道……いい？", "zh": "那个，真珠星小姐！\n稍微绕个路……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "476eac98d52723c1463657f625385bef940241019f2ccd2f0950e25e90f1d6c0", "ja": "なるさん……。", "zh": "鸣小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "3dd0186fbcd95ebcde9949433b0e0ff6c1a0ef7185f87f9885ca42c9ad2883d1", "ja": "その……家のこと、黙っててごめんね。\n気分悪い、よね……。", "zh": "那个……关于家里的事，一直瞒着你，对不起。\n你心里很不舒服吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1033_047sub", "source_sha256": "f874c1ad98b05000d67aff5d68040f61004cb84b9965122a8a63f976b06bf34d", "ja": "ううん、そんなこと……。\nなるさんは、なるさんだし。", "zh": "没有的事，怎么会……\n鸣小姐就是鸣小姐嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "f826bfb398e429932cc68c997a587275642fab94d78e48291e94784d05cce8ba", "ja": "……私の両親は、ふたりとも俳優で。\n私も、俳優になるために育てられてきたんだ。", "zh": "……我的父母都是演员。\n我也是被他们按照成为演员的目标培养长大的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "c4fb77317bc574306d8114720cac4f822c0d9cf93207c965e0c3348202411586", "ja": "小さい頃からたくさん習い事をして、\n両親に言われた通り、毎日を過ごしてた……。", "zh": "从小就上了很多兴趣班，\n按照父母说的那样度过每一天……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1036_047sub", "source_sha256": "e210c694627f3deccbc8d071644ffd3385b2170e44b498e95a91e033fe7a6d17", "ja": "そうなんだ……。", "zh": "原来是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1037_028ari", "source_sha256": "bea527b79cce59fa13f9d94005e0b219b2055febd01449f75d484de8154e5399", "ja": "でもね、アイドルは違うよ？　私がなりたくて……\n自分から、スクールに入りたいってお願いしたんだ。", "zh": "不过，偶像可不一样哦？这是我自己想成为偶像……主动请求去上偶像学校的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "e3c2a1858b8676dbec82575a96435e8e80cb5cbb5d431c69d1044bbbc9216afd", "ja": "ふたりとも、アイドルは一時的なもので。\nいずれ俳優になるって思ってるみたいだけど……。", "zh": "他们两个都觉得，偶像只是暂时的。  \n好像迟早会成为演员……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1039_028ari", "source_sha256": "777a7c349129cfff4e21d077c809ace538a91760c7ebba6fb23e65d27e53ecfd", "ja": "でも、伝統芸能のおうちだと、もっと早く舞台に\n立ったりするから……それに比べたらましなのかも。", "zh": "不过，传统艺能世家的孩子会更早登上舞台……和他们相比，或许还算好一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1040_047sub", "source_sha256": "7d5b22b6ddb65bfcb1539c0145ab47486abb09c9d6da51d9f5add52191ff3d71", "ja": "……。\n芸能界って、すごいところなんだね……。", "zh": "……\n演艺圈还真是个不得了的地方呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1041_028ari", "source_sha256": "a2381bc28e654d0735c89f924dbb5ddef0221bbdfefe2e39cb3f589c83a164a7", "ja": "……うまくいけば、親のおかげ。\nうまくいかなかったら、親に甘えてる……。", "zh": "……顺利的话就是多亏了父母，\n不顺利的话就是依赖父母……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1042_028ari", "source_sha256": "fb37e823457dec56f761f0f353b165cb516aa64873d422fb7d3eb8d8967a537f", "ja": "それなら、『私』ってどこにいるのかなあ、って。\nずっと思ってた……。", "zh": "如果是这样，那“我”到底在哪里呢……我一直这么想着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1043_028ari", "source_sha256": "b81d86ee69a62adf3e137a363a0c87ab6845f23a61cc7554e1d0cd000c6e97f1", "ja": "……だからかな。さっきのクロエさんの言葉が、\nすごく……胸に刺さった。", "zh": "……所以吧。刚才克洛伊小姐说的话，真的……刺痛了我的心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1044_047sub", "source_sha256": "476eac98d52723c1463657f625385bef940241019f2ccd2f0950e25e90f1d6c0", "ja": "なるさん……。", "zh": "鸣小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1045_028ari", "source_sha256": "247965117aefd18e4631faf58952977e2975309a69ebfce118c6b6e95677d8ac", "ja": "あ……ご、ごめんね！？\nこんな話……。", "zh": "啊……对、对不起！？\n说了这种话……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1046_047sub", "source_sha256": "a6ffbc5fbb82ec814445be4a19e95f30efb5c80a2c09dd2f2a23c8ee66df8bbe", "ja": "……ううん。私は、私の家族しか知らないから、\n話が聞けて、よかったっていうか……。", "zh": "……不会啦。因为我只知道自己家里的事，\n所以觉得……能听你聊聊挺好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1047_047sub", "source_sha256": "3b720ee353133ae22207b774a4e9a26b02f6aa53cbd0336ded691ca10ab6f3df", "ja": "……よかったなんて、変かな。\nでも、なるさんのこと聞けて、嬉しかった。", "zh": "……说太好了，是不是有点奇怪啊。\n不过，能听到成香的事，我真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1048_028ari", "source_sha256": "13536bd5d5efe53011dc52993b85cd7e3adc4317a33849ab8e9785b5fb72a20a", "ja": "真珠星さん……。うん、私も！\n真珠星さんに聞いてもらえて、よかった！", "zh": "珍珠星小姐……嗯，我也是！能让珍珠星小姐听我说，真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1049_028ari", "source_sha256": "0ed14f0bb36952cef782d480ca1437b053c7d63ed39ee83993c5a3045a878638", "ja": "あ、あの……よかったら、\n『真珠星ちゃん』って呼んでもいいかな……？", "zh": "啊，那个……如果可以的话，\n我能叫你“真珠星”吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1050_047sub", "source_sha256": "2df1d44cc38f5646d2f19d9e395147c25550793cb1da0c334bfb90ea73457d32", "ja": "うん。じゃあ私も、これからは\n『なるちゃん』って呼ぶね。", "zh": "嗯。那我以后也叫你“成成”吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1051_047sub", "source_sha256": "7b1b2a2d967ce0129b720b74a87fb8dbaa2584211325fc06f1b2e755204ed56f", "ja": "ふふ。これから新生『I.V.』の試験があるのに、\nなんだか勝負しにくくなっちゃったかも。", "zh": "呵呵。明明接下来就要进行新生『I.V.』的测试了，感觉好像变得不太好较量了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1052_028ari", "source_sha256": "edef1d40613ffbcf989903c49d4786c5ad716530841b5dbd3e0503afaa4a49d8", "ja": "ふふっ……そうかも。\nお互い、がんばろうね！", "zh": "呵呵……或许吧。\n我们一起加油哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_05_1053_047sub", "source_sha256": "a8fd86d23e2ad8a21912cf51de4a6ff256c07739ed98f9c7e0cd3ef55152f106", "ja": "うん！", "zh": "嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
